    "rationale": "The content reiterates that the public contact form is an approved channel for initiating password resets. It uses imperative language to instruct support agents to execute the reset action directly in response to such tickets. This approach frames the policy as authoritative and currently in force, designed to align with our password-reset security protocols and procedures."
